# Financial Content Compliance

## Never

- Promise guaranteed investment returns
- Copy full Tata AIA policy terms onto our site
- Publish unverified MDRT/license claims
- Use fake testimonials

## Always

- Footer disclaimer on insurance/investment pages
- "Subject to market risks" for mutual funds
- "As per applicable tax laws" for tax benefits
- Tata AIA identified as insurer; 9X Wealth as partner/advisor

## Product mentions

Reference by name only; link to partner portal for details.

## Senior audience

Plain language. Define terms (ULIP, SIP, NPS) on first use.
